			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 706810301,
					"content": "呼…总算得救了。谢谢你们！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810302,
					"content": "我叫格茜妮，如你们所见，是一位冒险家。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810303,
					"content": "你们身手这么了得，一定不是普通人吧！难道是好心的骑士？或者是云游四方的游侠？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810304,
						706810305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810304,
					"content": "我是路过的旅行者。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810309
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706810309,
					"content": "#我叫派蒙，{M#他}{F#她}是{NICKNAME}。其实{M#他}{F#她}也是冒险家协会的成员哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810310,
					"content": "原来是冒险家前辈！真是人外有人啊，这么难缠的魔物，你们一下子就解决了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810311,
					"content": "不像我，训练的时候明明动作都记住了，结果到了实战，手脚就不听使唤…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810312,
					"content": "就像老师说的那样，我还得再锻炼个三五年吗？但是就这么空手回去也太丢脸了吧…呜呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810313,
					"content": "哎呀，我觉得只是经验的差距啦。我们也是经历了很多场实战，才能游刃有余的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810314,
						706810318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810314,
					"content": "首先要保持冷静。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810315
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706810315,
					"content": "是呀，新手在实战里都容易慌里慌张的，原本的实力都发挥不出来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810316,
					"content": "就算敌人看起来很强，也要冷静观察，找到他们的弱点哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810317,
					"content": "这样就能哐哐哐地解决战斗了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810320,
					"content": "原来是这样…不愧是经验丰富的前辈！看来我还得边旅行边磨练自己的本领呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810321,
					"content": "你也正在旅行中吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810322
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706810322,
					"content": "是的…我准备去<color=#00E1FFFF>璃月</color>看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810323,
					"content": "你们听说过璃月的武学吗？据说能让人飞檐走壁，刀枪不入，削铁如泥！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810324,
					"content": "要是能向高人请教，学到一二，以后的冒险就轻松不少了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810325,
					"content": "但说实话，虽然加入冒险家协会有一段时间了，我还是第一次出远门呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810326,
					"content": "唉，刚出城没多久就被魔物拦住，我真的能顺利走到璃月吗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810327,
						706810328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810327,
					"content": "我们也打算去璃月。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810329
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706810329,
					"content": "真的吗？难道前辈也打算寻访世外高人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810330,
					"content": "这倒不是啦。因为某些原因，我们正在各国旅行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810331,
					"content": "虽然对璃月还不是很了解，但是早晚也是要去看看的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810332,
					"content": "既然刚好顺路，一起过去也有个照应嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810333
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810333,
					"content": "哇，居然能跟厉害的前辈一起行动…我的旅途充满了希望！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810334
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810334,
					"content": "那让我来带路吧。我在出发之前仔细研究了地图，肯定不会迷路的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810328,
					"content": "要加入我们的队伍吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810329
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706810318,
					"content": "判断形势也很重要。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810319
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706810319,
					"content": "是呀，如果判断敌人的实力在自己之上，还是及时撤离比较好哦。恋战是很危险的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810305,
					"content": "我的身份不方便透露…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810306
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706810306,
					"content": "我明白的！你一定是身负秘密使命，只能低调行事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810307,
					"content": "差不多就是这样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706810308,
					"content": "好啦，你就别卖关子了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
