			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 706813101,
					"content": "呼…总算得救了。谢谢你们！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813102,
					"content": "我叫格茜妮，如你们所见，是一位冒险家。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813103,
					"content": "你们身手这么了得，一定不是普通人吧！难道是好心的骑士？或者是云游四方的游侠？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813104,
						706813105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813104,
					"content": "我是路过的旅行者。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706813109,
					"content": "#我叫派蒙，{M#他}{F#她}是{NICKNAME}。其实{M#他}{F#她}也是冒险家协会的成员哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813110,
					"content": "原来是冒险家前辈！真是人外有人啊，这么难缠的魔物，你们一下子就解决了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813111,
					"content": "不像我，训练的时候明明动作都记住了，结果到了实战，手脚就不听使唤…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813112,
					"content": "就像老师说的那样，我还得再锻炼个三五年吗？但是就这么空手回去也太丢脸了吧…呜呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813113,
					"content": "哎呀，我觉得只是经验的差距啦。我们也是经历了很多场实战，才能游刃有余的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813114,
						706813118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813114,
					"content": "首先要保持冷静。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706813115,
					"content": "是呀，新手在实战里都容易慌里慌张的，原本的实力都发挥不出来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813116,
					"content": "就算敌人看起来很强，也要冷静观察，找到他们的弱点哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813117,
					"content": "这样就能哐哐哐地解决战斗了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813120,
					"content": "原来是这样…不愧是经验丰富的前辈！看来我还得边旅行边磨练自己的本领呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813121,
					"content": "你也正在旅行中吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706813122,
					"content": "是的…我准备去<color=#00E1FFFF>璃月</color>看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813123,
					"content": "你们听说过璃月的武学吗？据说能让人飞檐走壁，刀枪不入，削铁如泥！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813124,
					"content": "要是能向高人请教，学到一二，以后的冒险就轻松不少了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813125,
					"content": "但说实话，虽然加入冒险家协会有一段时间了，我还是第一次出远门呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813126,
					"content": "唉，刚出城没多久就被魔物拦住，我真的能顺利走到璃月吗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813127,
						706813128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813127,
					"content": "我们去过璃月。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813129
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706813129,
					"content": "呜哇，被厉害的前辈关照了，我的旅途充满了希望！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813130,
					"content": "不过，前辈想必很忙碌吧，还要花时间照顾我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813131,
						706813132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813131,
					"content": "见义勇为是我的日常。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706813133,
					"content": "那我就叨扰你们一段时间了！我在出发之前仔细研究了地图，我会尽量不拖后腿的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813132,
					"content": "帮助后辈也是正经事！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706813128,
					"content": "可以带你一程。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813129
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706813118,
					"content": "判断形势也很重要。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813119
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706813119,
					"content": "是呀，如果判断敌人的实力在自己之上，还是及时撤离比较好哦。恋战是很危险的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813105,
					"content": "我的身份不方便透露。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706813106,
					"content": "我明白的！你一定是身负秘密使命，只能低调行事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706813107,
					"content": "差不多就是这样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706813108,
					"content": "好啦，你就别卖关子了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706813109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		}
	]
